How many hours a day do you need to Ä сing?

240 — —
That depends on you. I work about four hours a day, six days a
week. ュ ن сes eight hours a day, from 9 A.M. to 6 P.M.
with a one-hour break. Robert เ сes four to five hours a
day, six days a week. Some ğ work only one hour a day;
